    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(\\frac{\\mathrm{dQ}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{KA} \\Delta \\mathrm{T}}{\\mathrm{x}}\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{1.56 \\times 10^5}{3600}=\\frac{\\mathrm{K} \\times 2 \\times 20}{12 \\times 10^{-2}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~K}=\\frac{1.56 \\times 10^5 \\times 12 \\times 10^{-2}}{3600 \\times 2 \\times 20} \\\\\n& =\\frac{1.56}{12}=0.13\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
  }
